{"execution_delta":{"candidate_count":5,"plan_ref":"rounds/round_0005/plan.json","schema_version":"algorithm-optimization-execution-delta/v1"},"plan":{"direction":"Replace constant mid-route depot pull alpha with a state-only capacity-phase decaying pull alpha_eff(pressure) so vehicles sweep outward early and spiral inward toward the depot as remaining capacity tightens.","hypothesis":"H-007: State-only decaying depot pull alpha_eff(pressure) = alpha_0 - alpha_1*pressure creates a smooth outside-in spiral without penalizing heavy stops, beating both Round 3 (-0.1576 dev4) and Round 4 (sh6=10.21, ana72=18.11).","operations":[{"mechanism":"Compute dimensionless vehicle capacity pressure = min(1.0, mean(demands[unvisited]) / max(rest_capacity, 1e-12)) depending ONLY on vehicle state (never per-candidate demand, avoiding anti-heavy bias). Set alpha_eff = alpha_0 - alpha_1 * pressure with alpha_0 in [0.90, 1.15] and alpha_1 in [0.50, 1.25] so early stops sweep outward (high alpha_eff) and near-full stops spiral inward toward the depot (low or slightly negative alpha_eff).","target":"constant mid-route depot pull alpha","type":"replace"},{"mechanism":"Combine (d_cur - alpha_eff * d_dep)/scale with elongation rho = d_cur/(d0i+d0j), angular coherence -w_cos*cos(theta_0) (w_cos in 0.12-0.25), calibrated fill bonus -beta*fill (beta in 0.08-0.14), two-phase rem_routes depot start, and capacity-adaptive early return (1 - rho < tau).","target":"Round 4's winning scale-free components (two-phase rem_routes start, elongation rho, Law-of-Cosines cos(theta_0), calibrated beta_fill, adaptive early return)","type":"preserve"},{"mechanism":"Verify every term is invariant under distance rescaling (0.01x and 1000x), and ensure outside-in depot start maximizes d_dep/scale (or minimizes -d_dep/scale) rather than accidentally reversing the sign.","target":"strict coordinate scale invariance and clean sign conventions","type":"preserve"}],"ref":"rounds/round_0005/plan.json","semantic_alignme